diff --git a/CHANGES.md b/CHANGES.md
index 516234e58..316a0641e 100644
--- a/CHANGES.md
+++ b/CHANGES.md
@@ -3,6 +3,17 @@ refactorings and bug fixes are not reported here.
 
 # Development
 
+### Discovery over #None with the secure-only server config
+
+`UA_ServerConfig_setDefaultWithSecureSecurityPolicies` now adds
+SecurityPolicy#None for the discovery services only and sets
+`securityPolicyNoneDiscoveryOnly`. Clients can call GetEndpoints and
+FindServers over #None to learn the endpoints and the server certificate
+([OPC UA Part 4, 5.4.1](https://reference.opcfoundation.org/specs/OPC-10000-4/5.4.1)).
+No endpoint and no UserTokenPolicy is created for #None, and every other
+service on a #None SecureChannel is rejected with `BadSecurityPolicyRejected`.
+Applications that added #None themselves for this purpose can drop that code.
+
 ### Configure the advertised server profiles explicitly
 
 `UA_ServerConfig.serverProfileArray` and `serverProfileArraySize` now determine
